From 9ecf506da71f9650c12f04cd1c8acdc5845a4e26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dmayala <dmayala@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 04:56:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0040] drm/a9_eink: preserve complete targets and suppress
 duplicates safely

Retain whole conditioned targets and derive target damage against committed
history. Suppress ordinary equal targets without new power or waveform.

Review 22: preserve 0039 live-rail validation and containment. Consume the
exact FP status from temperature reads so a later good PG cannot erase a
dropout; validate again before accepting a duplicate skip. Never energize
an off pipeline for a no-op. Keep fault acknowledgement and full recovery.

Anchor the soft idle hold to the last real transport output, not duplicate,
rejected or dry kicks. Expiry wins before/after work; hold=0 only reuses queued
work after actual physical output. Preserve failed-off retries.
Absolute HV origins, fresh fixed-bin admission, max_on, progress interlock,
starvation latch and K=12 remain unchanged. Apply after 0039.
